# --- Sensitive / non-shareable source data -----------------------------------
# The raw workbook may contain more than the published aggregates, so it stays
# out of version control until information-governance approval is confirmed.
# Ignore everything under data-raw/ EXCEPT the extraction script(s), so the
# pipeline itself is committed and visible.
data-raw/*
!data-raw/*.R
!data-raw/.gitkeep

# Belt-and-braces: never commit spreadsheets from anywhere in the tree.
*.xlsx
*.xls

# The aggregate counts under data/ ARE already published (Tables 1 and 3) and
# are intended to be committed. If your team prefers to withhold them, move them
# to data-raw/ instead.

# --- R session / build artefacts ---------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj.bak

# --- OS cruft ----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.Rproj.user
.Rdata
.httr-oauth
.quarto
